 G('Estruturas concessivas',['Estrutura','Exemplo'],[['Much as + sujeito + verbo','**Much as I admire** her, I disagree.'],['Adjetivo/advérbio + as + sujeito + verbo','**Tired as I was**, I kept working.'],['Try as + sujeito + might','**Try as he might**, he could not win.'],['Strange as it may seem,…','**Strange as it may seem**, it worked.'],['Whatever / however + adj','**However strong** your doubts,…'],['although / though / even though','**Though** places are limited,…']],'**Much as = although/ even though** (concessão): o verbo da oração com *as* vai no **sujeito + verbo** normal. Em *Tired as I was*, o adjetivo vem **antes** de *as*.','✗ *Although much as I admire…* (não repita a concessão).'),
