 ('Reading · An academic text',text('Abstract: Mistrust in Cross-Border Deals',['Cultural misreadings **give rise to** mistrust, and mistrust **gives rise to** costly delays. In a study of 120 contracts, ambiguous wording **gave rise to** disputes in a third of cases. Such ambiguity **may give rise to** legal challenges, although the **extent to which** this occurs varies by sector.','The authors conclude that clear drafting does not eliminate disagreement, but it **gives rise to** fewer surprises. Further work should examine **what gives rise to** ambiguity in the first place.'],kicker='ABSTRACT',by='Journal of International Business (fictional)',gloss=[('mistrust','desconfiança'),('ambiguous','ambíguo'),('drafting','redação de contrato'),('surprise','surpresa')])),
